> Both of these questions seem to fall into a broader topic - when is it useful/advisable (or not) to put the same covariate on two different sub-models within a hierarchical model. Without having implemented a substantive literature search, I am aware of one paper that looks into this topic (Monroe et al. 2019 <https://doi.org/10.1002/ecs2.2791>). Is anyone aware of any others off the top of your head? Does this seem like an unstudied or understudied question?
